# free CARTO API key for the map's basemap tiles - CARTO started requiring
# one on the raster tile endpoints (basemaps.cartocdn.com) from 26 Aug 2026.
# grab one free (no card, no CARTO account) at https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey
# - just an email + domain + a one-line description, instant, 5,000,000
# tiles/month free. copy this file to .env.local and paste the real key in -
# .env.local is already gitignored, this .env.example file is the only one
# that's tracked in the repo
VITE_CARTO_API_KEY=

# optional - enables "Sign in with Google" and Firestore cloud sync for
# climbs, custom peaks and the resume builder. leave all six
# of these blank and the app runs exactly as it does now, fully offline on
# localStorage - src/lib/firebase.ts just no-ops if any are missing.
#
# get these from a Firebase project's Project settings > General > Your apps
# (console.firebase.google.com) - create a Web app if you haven't already.
# also needs: Authentication > Sign-in method > Google enabled, and a
# Firestore database created (any region) with rules restricting each
# person's doc to themselves, e.g.:
#   match /logbooks/{uid} { allow read, write: if request.auth.uid == uid; }
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=